[[Legendary Rune]]s are [[upgrade component]]s that, once socketed, have the power to take on the properties of any other superior [[rune]]. Legendary runes and [[Legendary Sigil|sigils]] can be removed from [[equipment]] of any rarity without needing to use an [[Upgrade Extractor]].

A maximum of 7 legendary runes can be added to an account's [[Legendary Armory]], enough for all [[armor]] and [[Aquatic Headgear|aquatic headgear]] upgrade slots. Despite being a legendary item, they have no unique visual effects.

== Lore ==
{{Legendary unlock text|Lady Nari once wrote that runes are imbued with the memories of ancient warriors and that the effects they grant are remnants of their power.}}

