== Notes ==
* It is possible to create more than 7 runes, which leads to nothing.<ref>[https://www.reddit.com/r/Guildwars2/comments/15lqkdr/im_the_14_legendary_runes_person/ Reddit Thread by u/Bray_of_cats on the GuildWars 2 Subreddit], Reddit.com</ref>
* Legendary runes work together with exotic superior runes of the same kind, e.g. two Legendary Runes of Melandru and four exotic [[Superior Rune of Melandru|Superior Runes of Melandru]] grant all six bonuses of the Superior Rune of Melandru.
* Unlike the superior runes they emulate, legendary runes require level 80 gear to equip instead of level 60.

== Trivia ==
* Legendary runes and sigils were [https://www.guildwars2.com/en/news/harness-the-power-of-legendary-upgrades/ officially announced] on July 24, 2019, and added into the game on July 30, 2019.

